        "quotedText": "2 Upon Administrator´s request, and subject to the confidentiality obligations set forth in this DPA, Alaio shall make available to User that is not a competitor of Alaio (or Administrator´s  independent, third-party auditor that is not a competitor of Bitrix24) information regarding Alaio compliance with the obligations set forth in this DPA and the security measures as described in the Appendix 2 to this DPA. Administrator may contact Alaio to request an on-site inspection of the architecture, systems and procedures relevant to the protection of Personal Data at locations where Personal Data is stored. Administrator shall reimburse Alaio for any time expended by Alaio or its third-party Sub-processors for any such on-site inspection at the Alaio then-current professional services rates, which shall be made available to Administrator upon request. Before the commencement of any such on-site audit, Administrator and Alaio shall mutually agree upon the scope, timing, and duration of the inspection in addition to the reimbursement rate for which Administrator",
